  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So, a new batch of clinical data\njust dropped for a drug called\nIBI363, and it’s getting a lot of\nattention. What’s the big picture",
    "start": 6.769,
    "end": 11.343,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "clinical data",
      "IBI363"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "here?",
    "start": 11.343,
    "end": 15.917,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "clinical data",
      "IBI363"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Right. This is from a Nomura\nreport on Innovent’s IBI363, which\nis a PD-1/IL2 bispecific. The\nearly-stage data for non-small",
