    "end": 36.363,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "first-line treatment",
      "IO-resistant"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "The IO-resistant late-stage NSCLC\ndata is probably the most\nimportant. For patients who’ve\nalready failed immunotherapy, the",
    "start": 36.723,
    "end": 40.763,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "IO-resistant",
      "late-stage NSCLC",
      "failed immunotherapy"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "median overall survival was 18.",
    "start": 40.763,
    "end": 44.803,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "IO-resistant",
      "late-stage NSCLC",
      "failed immunotherapy"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "2 months, with a 24-month survival\nrate of nearly 48%.",
    "start": 45.163,
    "end": 48.6,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "2 months",
      "24-month survival rate",
      "48%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "That sounds strong. How does that\ncompare to what’s already out\nthere?",
    "start": 48.96,
    "end": 52.118,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "strong",
      "compare"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "For context, a large trial called\nTROPPIN-Lung01 showed a median\noverall survival of just 9. 4\nmonths in a similar population. So",
    "start": 52.478,
    "end": 57.517,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "TROPPIN-Lung01",
