    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "smaller patient group"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "And what about the first-line\nsetting, for patients who haven’t\nbeen treated yet?",
