    "end": 70.056,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "first-line setting"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "There, the most interesting result\nis from a sub-group that used a\nspecific dosing schedule—3 mg per\nkg then dropping to 1. 5 mg per",
