    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "catch",
      "caveats"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Absolutely. First, both of these\nare based on relatively small\npatient cohorts, so we need larger\ntrials to confirm. And second,",
    "start": 87.61,
    "end": 92.3,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
