      "larger trials",
      "safety"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "safety is a key concern.",
    "start": 92.3,
    "end": 96.991,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "small patient cohorts",
      "larger trials",
      "safety"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "In the IO-resistant group, over\n99% of patients had\ntreatment-related side effects,\nand nearly half were grade 3 or",
